<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1506_5421.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Allerdurchluechtigster</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">großmaechtigster</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unuber</unclear>-
<lb n="2"/>windtlichster roemischer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kaeißer</unclear>,
<lb n="3"/>E. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Keiß</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mt</unclear>. seyen unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underthaenigste</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußerst</unclear>
<lb n="4"/>willige dienst zuvor, allergnedigster her,
<lb n="5"/>E. K. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mt</unclear>. werden von unsern lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitbuergern</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Christoph</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Cuerers</unclear></persName>, <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Joerg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kaeßlers</unclear></persName>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">irer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mit</unclear>-
<lb n="7"/>handelsverwandten bestelten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">agenten</unclear>, allergnedigst
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vernemen</unclear>, in waß terminis <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ire</unclear> gegen und wider
<lb n="9"/>etliche <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Juden</unclear>, nunmehr <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lange</unclear> zeit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gefuerte</unclear> recht-
<lb n="10"/>fertigung, diser zeit stehe. Und wie die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ermelte</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>Judenschafft, auf e. k. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mt</unclear>. in diser sach bißher
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allergnedigste</unclear> ertheilte und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allerbillichste</unclear> reso-
<lb n="13"/>lutiones und decreta, gar nichts achten
<lb n="14"/>noch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sezen</unclear>; und dardurch die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesazte</unclear> handels-
<lb n="15"/>verwandte, an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stat</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">billicher</unclear>
<lb n="16"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schuldiger</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bezahlung</unclear>, in daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußersto</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ellend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stuerzen</unclear>, wo nit e. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">keiß</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mt</unclear>. die
<lb n="18"/>allergnedigste <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versehung</unclear> thun <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear>, damit
<lb n="19"/>die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochnotwendige</unclear> execution <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> hand genomen,
<lb n="20"/>und durch dieselbe, die so unbefuegter weiß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinder</unclear>-
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stellige</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerspennige</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Juden</unclear>, zum <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gehorsam</unclear>,
<lb n="22"/>und der billigkeit gebracht werden.
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hierauf</unclear> gelangt an e. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">keiß</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mt</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unser</unclear>, von
<lb n="24"/>wegen obgemelter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochbetrengter</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genzlich</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erößter</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">außgesogner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">handelsluethen</unclear>, ganz
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underthaenigste</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">flehe</unclear>, die wellen doch
<lb n="27"/>die grosse <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußerste</unclear> not, und vor augen schwebendes,
<lb n="28"/>ja inen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">albereit</unclear> auf dem halß ligendes verderben,
<lb n="29"/>und daß die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschwerten</unclear>, in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dasselbige</unclear> so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unschuldiger</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>und unbillicher weiß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eingefuert</unclear> werden, aller-
<lb n="31"/>gnedigst zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herzen</unclear> nemen; und deßhalben
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1506_5422.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wol</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> wegen der lieben justitien, alß auß
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allermiltister</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbaermbd</unclear>, den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">truebseligen</unclear>
<lb n="34"/>armen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geprässten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">leueten</unclear>, mit iren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kaiser=</unclear>
<lb n="35"/>lichen gnaden allergnedigst und alß zu hilff
<lb n="36"/>komen, damit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sij</unclear> doch zu dem jenigen
<lb n="37"/>darzu <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sij</unclear> befugt und E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kaijß</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mt</unclear>. albereit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear>
<lb n="38"/>billich und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechtmessig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erkennt</unclear>, nun mehr ohne
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lengeren</unclear> verzug komen und gelangen moegend:
<lb n="40"/>Und hierinnen ir Kaiserliche <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">miltigkeit</unclear>, nit
<lb n="41"/>weniger, alß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sij</unclear> bißher gegen allen und jeden
<lb n="42"/>armen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">betrangten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gethan</unclear> haben, aller=
<lb n="43"/>gnedigst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widrumb</unclear> erzeigen und
<lb n="44"/>beweisen. Dessen werden von Gott dem
<lb n="45"/>Allmechtigen E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kaijß</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mt</unclear>. reiche vergeltung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">un=</unclear>
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">felbarlich</unclear> empfahen; und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> derselben aller=
<lb n="47"/>bestendigste, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fridfertig=</unclear> und glueckseligste regie=
<lb n="48"/>rung, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesundheit</unclear> und langes leben, werden
<lb n="49"/>die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mehrerzelte</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">betrangte</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">leuet</unclear>, in den himel
<lb n="50"/>mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unaufhoerlichem</unclear> gebett <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allezeit</unclear> rueffen;
<lb n="51"/>Und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gleicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gestalt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wollen</unclear> E. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Kaijß</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mt</unclear>. wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear>
<lb n="52"/>in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unserem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">demuetigen</unclear> gebett <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gott</unclear> angelegen
<lb n="53"/>sein lassen, zu dessen heiligem schirm,
<lb n="54"/>E. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Kaijß</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mt</unclear>. wir
<lb n="55"/>in getroester allergnedigster willfarung, under=
<lb n="56"/>thenigst befelhen. Dat. <origDate when="1606-07-22" resp="#ner">den 12. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">22</unclear>. julii
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ao</unclear>. 1606</origDate>.
<lb n="58"/>E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kaijß</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mt</unclear>.
<lb n="59"/>Underthenigstwillige
<lb n="60"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">B. und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rhat</unclear> der stadt
<lb n="61"/>SantGallen</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1506_5423.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="62"/>Dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allerdurchleüchtigisten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">großmaechtigisten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unuber</unclear>-
